    <div>
      <p begin="00:00.500" end="00:02.090" ttm:agent="v1">AV got that drip hoe</p>
      <p begin="00:02.090" end="00:04.660" ttm:agent="v1">I said bitch tell me what the fuck is up</p>
      <p begin="00:04.660" end="00:07.080" ttm:agent="v1">You said you wanted me, but I don't know where the fuck you are</p>
      <p begin="00:07.080" end="00:09.140" ttm:agent="v1">I swear you was the one, but now I think you went and run</p>
      <p begin="00:09.140" end="00:11.380" ttm:agent="v1">I got a 40 check 'cause she that bitch you never trust</p>
      <p begin="00:11.380" end="00:13.620" ttm:agent="v1">I'm next up, flexed up, ain't no bubblegum</p>
      <p begin="00:13.620" end="00:15.450" ttm:agent="v1">Boy you faked up, rest up, smoke a bubblegum</p>
      <p begin="00:15.450" end="00:17.660" ttm:agent="v1">I be gettin' the bag while you counting them ones</p>
      <p begin="00:17.660" end="00:20.020" ttm:agent="v1">Why the fuck you be callin', but now you never showin' up</p>
      <p begin="00:20.020" end="00:21.950" ttm:agent="v1">I said bitch tell me what the fuck is up</p>
      <p begin="00:21.950" end="00:24.350" ttm:agent="v1">You said you wanted me, but I don't know where the fuck you are</p>
      <p begin="00:24.350" end="00:26.630" ttm:agent="v1">I swear you was the one, but now I think you went and run</p>
      <p begin="00:26.630" end="00:28.480" ttm:agent="v1">I got a 40 check 'cause she that bitch you never trust</p>
      <p begin="00:28.480" end="00:30.640" ttm:agent="v1">I'm next up, flexed up, ain't no bubblegum</p>
      <p begin="00:30.640" end="00:33.090" ttm:agent="v1">Boy you faked up, rest up, smoke a bubblegum</p>
      <p begin="00:33.090" end="00:35.030" ttm:agent="v1">I be gettin' the bag while you counting them ones</p>
      <p begin="00:35.030" end="00:37.040" ttm:agent="v1">Why the fuck you be callin', but now you never showin' up</p>
      <p begin="00:37.040" end="00:39.280" ttm:agent="v1">Said bitch wait, I put my trust in you for you to flake</p>
      <p begin="00:39.280" end="00:42.150" ttm:agent="v1">All these bitches want me 'cause they see I'm gettin' to the cake</p>
      <p begin="00:42.150" end="00:43.650" ttm:agent="v1">What's the word?</p>
      <p begin="00:42.430" end="00:43.930" ttm:agent="v1">The lovin' you been givin' me is real fake</p>
      <p begin="00:43.630" end="00:45.880" ttm:agent="v1">Why your ex keep callin' your phone, it's too late</p>
      <p begin="00:45.880" end="00:48.250" ttm:agent="v1">'Cause I'm dumb rich, and for a fact you been knew</p>
      <p begin="00:48.250" end="00:50.250" ttm:agent="v1">See my Insta goin' up I'm spending time up in the stu</p>
      <p begin="00:50.250" end="00:52.170" ttm:agent="v1">Don't hit my line, 'cause I been doin' fine</p>
      <p begin="00:52.170" end="00:54.620" ttm:agent="v1">I'm gettin' more shit done without you</p>
      <p begin="00:54.620" end="00:56.120" ttm:agent="v1">I done made so many bands</p>
