      <p begin="00:59.340" end="01:01.260" ttm:agent="v1">Band kid, band class, baby they don't understand</p>
      <p begin="01:01.260" end="01:03.620" ttm:agent="v1">Fitted up, tell me what the fuck is a silly band?</p>
      <p begin="01:03.620" end="01:05.220" ttm:agent="v1">Waist cost a dime, you wonderin' how I get that</p>
      <p begin="01:05.220" end="01:07.930" ttm:agent="v1">Dumb bitch, never compared 'cause I'm dumb stacked</p>
      <p begin="01:07.930" end="01:10.410" ttm:agent="v1">Big bag, LV MCM Back Pack get back</p>
      <p begin="01:10.410" end="01:12.270" ttm:agent="v1">Choppa a German Shep, It'll bite back, bitch</p>
      <p begin="01:12.270" end="01:14.530" ttm:agent="v1">I said bitch tell me what the fuck is up</p>
      <p begin="01:14.530" end="01:16.130" ttm:agent="v1">You said you wanted me, but I don't know where the fuck you are</p>
      <p begin="01:16.130" end="01:18.830" ttm:agent="v1">I swear you was the one, but now I think you went and run</p>
      <p begin="01:18.830" end="01:20.980" ttm:agent="v1">I got a 40 check 'cause she that bitch you never trust</p>
      <p begin="01:20.980" end="01:22.850" ttm:agent="v1">I'm next up, flexed up, ain't no bubblegum</p>
