      <p begin="02:00.050" end="02:02.280" ttm:agent="v1">In a frat party with some dudes, I'm a sender</p>
      <p begin="02:02.280" end="02:04.130" ttm:agent="v1">Catch me simpin' for a hoe, bitch, you would never</p>
      <p begin="02:04.130" end="02:06.090" ttm:agent="v1">Like damn, what the fuck been goin' on?</p>
      <p begin="02:06.090" end="02:08.450" ttm:agent="v1">Man I have you all my heart and I waited so long</p>
      <p begin="02:08.450" end="02:10.760" ttm:agent="v1">You stabbed me in my back, suckin' other guy sacks</p>
      <p begin="02:10.760" end="02:12.810" ttm:agent="v1">Gettin' ran through like a track, you my fuckin' heart attack</p>
      <p begin="02:12.810" end="02:15.280" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, she tossed me into fire and she laughed at all my ashes</p>
      <p begin="02:15.280" end="02:17.180" ttm:agent="v1">I'm tired of this pain, I need this shit to be my last dance</p>
      <p begin="02:17.180" end="02:19.490" ttm:agent="v1">Don't ever hit my line, 'cause little hoe that was your last chance</p>
      <p begin="02:19.490" end="02:21.510" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, it's true, I loved you baby, but that shit was in the past tense</p>
      <p begin="02:21.510" end="02:23.610" ttm:agent="v1">I said bitch tell me what the fuck is up</p>
